"143","From Abu Hurairah, who reported that the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) ordered Bilal to announce to the people that none would enter Paradise except a Muslim."
"144","I asked Jabir b. 'Abd Allah about the battle in which a man was killed, and a dog was sent to announce it to the people. He said, ""We were at Hunayn, and the Prophet, peace be upon him, ordered a man to announce it to the people, saying, 'It is not for one who does not believe in Allah and the Last Day to enter Paradise.'"""
"145","I asked Jabir b. 'Abd Allah about the battle in which a man was killed, and a dog was sent to announce it to the people. He said, ""We were at Hunayn, and the Prophet, peace be upon him, ordered a man to announce it to the people, saying, 'It is not for one who does not believe in Allah and the Last Day to enter Paradise.'"""
"146","I asked Jabir b. 'Abd Allah about the battle in which a man was killed, and a dog was sent to announce it to the people. He said, ""We were at Hunayn, and the Prophet (peace be upon him) sent a dog to announce it to the people, saying, 'It will not enter Paradise except for a believer.'"""
"147","The believers in this world are three types: those who believe in Allah and His Messenger, then do not waver and strive with their wealth and lives in the way of Allah, and those who are wronged by people in their wealth and lives, then those who, when they look at something, abandon it for the sake of Allah, the Exalted."
"148","The believer is generous and noble, and the wicked is miserly and ignoble."
"149","And from him, 'Ayadh, from the Prophet, peace be upon him, who said: ""Allah, the Exalted, said: 'The believer is with me in the rank of every good, he praises me and I am pleased with his soul from between his two sides.'"""
150,The believer will be tested by his/her devils just as a traveler is tested by his/her baggage.
"151","The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) said: ""I will inform you of the believer, the one whom people have entrusted with their properties and their lives, and the Muslim, the one who is at peace with the Muslims from his tongue and hand, and the mujahid, the one who has fought for his soul in the obedience of Allah, and the migrant, the one who has fled from the abominations and sins."""
"152","Musa bin Ali said, ""I heard my father say, 'I heard Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-As say, 'I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) say, ""Do you know what the Muslim is?"" They said, ""God and His Messenger know best."" He said, ""The Muslim is he whose tongue and hand are pure."" He said, ""Do you know who the believer is?"" They said, ""God and His Messenger know best."" He said, ""The believer is he who believes in Allah and His Messenger, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, and believes in the testimony of the oneness of Allah, 